> = What is PGP/<nowiki>GnuPG</nowiki>? =
> 
> PGP = Pretty Good Privacy
> 
> GPG = Gnu Privacy Guard
> 
> PGP is software first developed by Phil Zimmermann used to encrypt data, text, or emails to help ensure privacy.
> 
> GPG is software that povides PGP ability for the Linux world. It was developed by the Gnu project at the Free Software Foundation.
